cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this applet, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Discrete 1D Quantum Walk – interactive applet"
abstract: >-
  Interactive CindyJS applet for the discrete one-dimensional quantum walk of a qubit,
  designed for physics and mathematics education. It visualises amplitudes as arrows,
  the probability distribution, the comparison with a classical Galton board,
  position and qubit measurements (single runs, exact ensemble average, collected
  frequencies) and an animation of the individual computation steps.
